abstract: Reproducible implementation of a leakage-controlled multimodal social bot detection pipeline with modality-specific experts, validation-guided routing, missingness-bias auditing, debiased learning, probability calibration, robustness stress tests, statistical inference, identifier-overlap auditing, and overlap-excluded TwiBot-20 validation.
